return"\ud83d\udccb *Application Received \u2014 {libraryName}*\n\nDear *{studentName}*,\nThank you for submitting your admission application! We have safely received your request and our desk management is reviewing your documents.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83d\udccc *APPLICATION SUMMARY*\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83d\udc64 *Applicant Name:* {studentName}\n\ud83d\udce6 *Selected Plan:* {planName}\n\ud83d\udcba *Preferred Desk:* {seatLabel}\n\u23f1\ufe0f *Review Window:* Usually approved within 24 hours\n\nWe will notify you immediately once your admission is approved. \ud83c\udf93\u2728\n\n\ud83d\udcde *Helpline:* {libraryHelpline}\n\ud83d\udccd *Address:* {libraryAddress}\n\n\u2014 *Team {libraryName}*"
